WEBVTT

01:43.329 --> 01:44.930
It's, it's...

01:44.930 --> 01:47.660
It's almost time for the ghost
ship to reappear.

01:49.234 --> 01:50.667
Whoa, I got something.

01:55.074 --> 01:58.344
Hey, old man, I'm not the kind of fish
you want to catch to eat!

01:58.344 --> 02:00.676
But I do have a lot of calcium!

02:06.051 --> 02:08.349
It's here!

02:19.365 --> 02:20.733
A gold coin?

02:20.733 --> 02:22.428
There's more where that came from.

02:24.236 --> 02:27.205
If more is what you want,
more is what you'll get.

02:34.913 --> 02:37.882
I'll give you this much for now.

02:47.726 --> 02:52.390
The Ghost Ship of Blue Hawaii

02:54.800 --> 02:56.268
They say that it has come back!

02:56.268 --> 02:57.603
What?! Again?!

02:57.603 --> 02:59.872
The problems never end here.

02:59.872 --> 03:01.601
I'm so scared.

03:02.808 --> 03:04.376
What has come back?

03:04.376 --> 03:05.843
A beautiful woman?

03:06.278 --> 03:07.780
Who the hell are you?

03:07.780 --> 03:10.078
The ghost ship! The ghost
ship is back!

03:10.582 --> 03:11.717
A ghost ship...

03:11.717 --> 03:13.986
Lately, it's been popping up a lot

03:13.986 --> 03:16.221
and it's got everyone scared.

03:16.221 --> 03:18.451
You guys are too easily frightened.

03:21.794 --> 03:23.989
All right, everyone, time to go home.
Break it up here!

03:31.203 --> 03:34.604
Oh, I knew a beautiful girl
would pop up soon!

03:35.040 --> 03:39.067
Are you guys deaf? I told everyone
to go home!

03:40.045 --> 03:42.581
Sorry, but it's impossible for me to
walk away from such a beauty

03:42.581 --> 03:44.149
even if she is telling us to scram.

03:44.149 --> 03:47.949
Oh, how nice! What an honest
little bird you have here!

03:48.687 --> 03:50.589
My name is Kir, nice to meet you.

03:50.589 --> 03:53.615
Could you point us in the direction
of the ghost ship?

03:54.359 --> 03:56.829
That ghost ship has been showing up
at the same cape every night.

03:56.829 --> 03:59.465
I have been very busy lately, what
with all this ghost ship business,

03:59.465 --> 04:01.333
and there's also been a rumor going
around that the Bandit King

04:01.333 --> 04:03.068
is going to be showing up here in
Blue Hawaii sometime soon.

04:03.068 --> 04:06.231
I'm so worn out! But hey,
why do you ask?

04:06.705 --> 04:09.572
What do you guys think
you're going to do?!

04:10.075 --> 04:11.542
What do you think?

04:11.977 --> 04:13.911
You guys are acting a little
too suspicious.

04:14.813 --> 04:16.515
I'm going to have to file a report!

04:16.515 --> 04:17.382
What's your name?

04:17.382 --> 04:19.418
I'm Kir!

04:19.418 --> 04:24.590
Don't make me ask again. What's
your name, you little delinquent?

04:24.590 --> 04:25.190
Jing.

04:25.190 --> 04:26.291
Jing...

04:26.291 --> 04:27.392
What is your job?

04:27.392 --> 04:28.193
Bandit.

04:28.193 --> 04:30.718
Okay, bandit... What?! Bandit?!

04:31.263 --> 04:32.631
I'm placing you under arrest!

04:32.631 --> 04:34.064
Wait, wait, hold on a sec!

04:34.399 --> 04:36.458
I haven't stolen anything yet, have I?

04:37.002 --> 04:39.129
No, but you're planning on it, right?

04:39.505 --> 04:40.706
Maybe...

04:40.706 --> 04:44.039
Hey, chief, it's the bandit.
He's given himself up!

04:44.610 --> 04:47.579
You're still asleep, old man?!

04:47.579 --> 04:50.605
Where has all of your pride and spunk
as the police chief gone?!

04:56.922 --> 04:59.858
He's been like this ever since he
came home the other night

04:59.858 --> 05:01.485
talking about having seen
the ghost ship!

05:01.994 --> 05:04.429
He went to take control of
the ghost ship situation,

05:04.429 --> 05:07.489
but I think those ghouls somehow
stole his soul or something!

05:07.933 --> 05:13.303
Hey, come on, wake up and get back
to work, Papa! Papa!

05:13.839 --> 05:16.275
If they stole his soul, wouldn't he
have died?

05:16.275 --> 05:20.412
What could they have wanted
from this old man?

05:20.412 --> 05:21.879
I'm not sure.

05:22.814 --> 05:24.281
Hey, hold up!

05:27.619 --> 05:29.746
Yo, Postino.

05:30.422 --> 05:32.083
Jing, have you heard?

05:32.925 --> 05:38.886
It seems that the ghost ship is
powered by greed and desire.

05:41.366 --> 05:44.236
By greed and desire?

05:44.236 --> 05:46.568
Those are two of my favorite
things in this world!

05:46.939 --> 05:48.429
Stop right there, criminal.

05:49.141 --> 05:50.943
I'm going with you!

05:50.943 --> 05:55.312
If you truly are a thief, then I'll be
able to catch you in the act.

06:12.297 --> 06:14.527
There it is!

06:16.735 --> 06:19.304
That's a zombie! A real, live zombie!

06:19.304 --> 06:23.208
Don't worry, baby. Kir's here
to protect you.

06:23.208 --> 06:26.311
Why is he getting on that ship?
What's he going to do?

06:26.311 --> 06:28.779
Hey, hey, hey, where are
you going, Jing?!

06:32.284 --> 06:33.751
Hey!

06:36.788 --> 06:40.189
Could you by any chance tell me
where the ghost ship is?

06:40.692 --> 06:42.561
A little punk like you isn't allowed
on the ghost ship!

06:42.561 --> 06:45.530
You have to be at least
twenty years old!

06:47.432 --> 06:48.899
Kir! Rose!

06:51.536 --> 06:53.094
You guys be careful.

06:55.140 --> 06:56.471
They're fine.

06:59.745 --> 07:01.346
Oh, it stinks like alcohol.

07:01.346 --> 07:05.183
Hey! He's aiming for you,
so don't come over here!

07:05.183 --> 07:07.386
Stay away! Leave us alone.

07:07.386 --> 07:09.411
Kir, this is no time for a date!

07:14.826 --> 07:17.886
Don't tell me you're going to
place him under arrest?

07:32.544 --> 07:34.034
Kir Royale!

07:35.647 --> 07:37.114
Gold coins?

07:43.889 --> 07:47.791
I have a feeling these gold coins
will lead us to the ghost ship.

07:48.860 --> 07:52.631
Jing, this yellow coin road will vanish
if we don't follow it soon.

07:52.631 --> 07:53.965
All right, let's go.

07:53.965 --> 07:55.432
How do you intend to do that?

07:56.101 --> 07:57.335
We can ride this thing.

07:57.335 --> 08:00.133
It's way too big. How do you
plan on moving it?!

08:00.972 --> 08:02.564
I'm going to use my noggin.

08:04.476 --> 08:06.967
Any idiot could have come up
with this idea.

08:18.490 --> 08:21.926
I can already smell it,
the scent of treasure.

08:22.494 --> 08:24.155
I think we're almost there.

08:25.330 --> 08:26.797
And here we are.

08:27.999 --> 08:29.796
It's just about show time.

08:37.943 --> 08:40.002
There it is!

08:46.084 --> 08:51.423
Looks like they're slacking on posting
guards. I don't see anyone.

08:51.423 --> 08:54.326
The guards might be invisible men.

08:54.326 --> 08:56.317
I don't think so.

08:57.162 --> 09:00.825
The only thing moving is the anchor
and it's snoring.

09:02.901 --> 09:04.459
The anchor? Snoring?

09:09.141 --> 09:11.009
Oh, what a tasty looking little girl!

09:11.009 --> 09:12.644
Wait, save some for me!

09:12.644 --> 09:14.703
Dream on guys, this girl's mine!

09:17.149 --> 09:19.785
I can't believe it! The anchor is alive!

09:19.785 --> 09:21.987
Hey, what about Jing?
Where did he go?!

09:21.987 --> 09:23.454
He went to distract the anchor.

09:24.456 --> 09:26.253
You'll make a nice little snack!

09:29.294 --> 09:31.159
Don't you know that nap time
comes before snack time!

09:34.900 --> 09:37.266
No, I think you're going to be
the one put to sleep here!

09:37.803 --> 09:39.270
Jing...

09:44.009 --> 09:45.310
Jing!

09:45.310 --> 09:45.510
What?
Jing!

09:45.510 --> 09:46.845
What?

09:46.845 --> 09:50.015
Oh, shaking in her arms,
so happy, yet so scared.

09:50.015 --> 09:51.750
Hey, give me that bag.

09:51.750 --> 09:53.217
Bag?

09:54.519 --> 09:58.649
This is wine! I can't allow
underage boys to drink!

09:58.957 --> 10:01.983
If I want to fight with him, I need
a way to breathe underwater!

10:02.594 --> 10:04.429
Empty it out for me!

10:04.429 --> 10:07.132
I get it. I guess I can allow that!

10:07.132 --> 10:08.599
Let's rock!

10:14.506 --> 10:18.704
He's just a big glob of iron.
How can he move so quickly?

10:21.813 --> 10:23.280
Take this!

10:23.915 --> 10:25.382
My sword is useless!

10:26.918 --> 10:30.251
Kir, I need you! Rose,
empty out more bags!

10:31.523 --> 10:33.423
Good luck, Jing!

10:37.996 --> 10:40.123
You won't need those bags
where you're going!

10:40.632 --> 10:43.999
You don't need air if you
can't take a breath!

10:46.872 --> 10:49.397
Hey, Jing, below us! He's attacking
from underneath!

10:54.346 --> 10:55.813
Kir Royale!

11:00.552 --> 11:02.520
What was that?!

11:03.154 --> 11:04.781
Kir Royale did nothing!

11:05.590 --> 11:07.023
We need air!

11:09.361 --> 11:13.161
What the! I thought I told Rose
to empty out ALL the wine first!

11:13.732 --> 11:15.199
He's coming again, Jing!

11:24.476 --> 11:26.103
Looks like someone needs more
shooting practice, boy!

11:26.411 --> 11:29.039
Are you drunk, Jing?! Take better aim!

11:30.448 --> 11:34.319
So you were aiming at my chain?
You'll never break it!

11:34.319 --> 11:36.651
I might not break it, but you can't
control him if you can't hold on!

11:37.055 --> 11:39.319
Ow, hot! Hot!

11:40.659 --> 11:43.958
Oh, I can't stop him!

11:46.131 --> 11:47.792
Just as I thought, he's sinking
all the way to the bottom!

11:56.241 --> 11:57.708
You can be pretty tough, can't you?

11:58.276 --> 11:59.743
Jing! Kir!

12:08.219 --> 12:10.710
That place looks even
scarier than you.

12:17.929 --> 12:19.564
Jing, this is...

12:19.564 --> 12:21.725
Just as I thought, let's go!

12:45.123 --> 12:46.224
Just as I thought...

12:46.224 --> 12:47.525
What do you mean?

12:47.525 --> 12:50.653
Back when we were in
the Capital of Thieves,

12:51.096 --> 12:53.398
there was a huge rumor going around
about a secret gambling boat

12:53.398 --> 12:56.534
that appeared in the waters
around this area.

12:56.534 --> 13:00.138
Gambling? That's against the law!
Gambling is forbidden!

13:00.138 --> 13:06.668
Well, this ship is just one huge casino.

13:10.482 --> 13:11.883
A casino?

13:11.883 --> 13:14.352
Yup, hiding under the image
of a ghost ship

13:14.352 --> 13:17.446
is the perfect camouflage for an
underground gambling operation.

13:17.822 --> 13:20.625
That means I'm going to have
to arrest all of them!

13:20.625 --> 13:23.651
Hold off for a second, let's see
if we can have a little fun first.

13:24.029 --> 13:26.361
What? Hey, wait a minute!

13:26.798 --> 13:29.901
This is the first time I've seen
so many gold coins!

13:29.901 --> 13:32.037
They're not worth anything.
They're just chips.

13:32.037 --> 13:35.874
As a police officer, I cannot allow an
underage boy like you to gamble!

13:35.874 --> 13:38.866
Welcome to the Monte Carlo
Gambling House!

13:39.444 --> 13:41.880
It has been many years since we've
had a gathering of spirits like this

13:41.880 --> 13:45.650
to all have a great time together.
Won't you join us?

13:45.650 --> 13:49.220
Many years? A gathering of spirits?

13:49.220 --> 13:52.957
My name is Grappa, the manager
of this casino.

13:52.957 --> 13:58.563
I don't care who you are,
or where you came from,

13:58.563 --> 14:01.366
but I take care of everyone
who enters my casino.

14:01.366 --> 14:02.993
Please enjoy yourselves.

14:03.668 --> 14:05.329
What a shady dude!

14:05.804 --> 14:06.871
Come on and place your bets!

14:06.871 --> 14:09.741
I have this sorry, old,
senile cat, Tom, here.

14:09.741 --> 14:12.710
Where do you think he will
run out of breath and stop?

14:17.582 --> 14:20.318
You sure about that kid? You're just
throwing your money away.

14:20.318 --> 14:24.089
The crown?! It hasn't stopped there
in a thousand years!

14:24.089 --> 14:27.625
All right, everyone ready!
Say it with me now!

14:27.625 --> 14:29.354
Cat and Mouse!

14:30.128 --> 14:34.064
Okay, Tom, you ready to run around
in circles like a nice, old cat?

14:41.439 --> 14:43.669
Crown, crown...

14:44.309 --> 14:45.640
Crown...

14:50.381 --> 14:51.848
Oh, so close!

14:52.750 --> 14:54.240
Kir?

14:57.155 --> 14:59.385
Oh, so perfect and round.

15:00.024 --> 15:01.292
Crown?!

15:01.292 --> 15:02.026
All right!

15:02.026 --> 15:02.794
What?!
All right!

15:02.794 --> 15:03.488
What?!

15:04.062 --> 15:05.430
Awesome!

15:05.430 --> 15:06.931
We did it, we did it!

15:06.931 --> 15:07.932
But how?

15:07.932 --> 15:09.695
And next we have...

15:17.709 --> 15:19.404
I love taking gold coin baths!

15:20.278 --> 15:21.479
How's the water?

15:21.479 --> 15:23.208
Oh, it's the best!

15:29.754 --> 15:32.245
I think you got too much pocket
money for a little kid!

15:32.524 --> 15:34.014
I might have to relieve you
of some of it!

15:36.761 --> 15:39.059
You're lucky you're just a kid, so
I won't beat you down too bad.

15:39.430 --> 15:44.299
I may be a kid, but I fight
like an adult!

15:47.872 --> 15:49.339
Bingo!

15:50.041 --> 15:51.941
Oh, that hit the spot!

15:53.311 --> 15:55.176
We shot clear though your stomach
and it doesn't hurt?

15:55.680 --> 15:58.148
I didn't even notice!

16:03.521 --> 16:06.979
Jing, my throat is all dried up,
I can't shoot any more for now.

16:07.792 --> 16:10.886
I think it's about time to
put the kids to sleep!

16:29.581 --> 16:32.317
Wow, his body totally collapsed!

16:32.317 --> 16:34.012
Why did he all of a sudden...

16:34.852 --> 16:39.585
During our fight, I noticed that a
gold coin he had was sparkling.

16:40.558 --> 16:42.093
All I did was aim for that.

16:42.093 --> 16:45.697
Well, I guess it wasn't a ghoul
living inside of him.

16:45.697 --> 16:47.289
It must have been the coin
keeping him alive.

16:47.699 --> 16:49.257
This whole casino is full of them.

16:49.801 --> 16:51.894
They're not people playing
with money.

16:52.537 --> 16:55.005
It's the money having its way
with the people.

17:08.553 --> 17:11.256
What?! Now this place looks
like a total dump!

17:11.256 --> 17:13.724
This is how it really looks.

17:15.927 --> 17:17.929
Not only did you win at my casino,

17:17.929 --> 17:22.127
but now it's your fault that
the entire place is ruined!

17:22.533 --> 17:24.102
You have become more than a small
nuisance to my business,

17:24.102 --> 17:25.694
and for that you will pay!

17:28.072 --> 17:29.539
Gold coins?!

17:31.976 --> 17:33.443
Rose! Don't budge!

17:33.945 --> 17:37.381
You will witness my true power when
I combine all of my savings!

17:43.888 --> 17:47.415
Now then, I think I'll have you
pay me back that money!

17:48.059 --> 17:50.862
I'm about to turn you
into pocket change!

17:50.862 --> 17:53.164
Impossible, wasteful, reckless!

17:53.164 --> 17:57.225
I'm sorry, but you are the one who
will be turned to rubbish!

18:04.142 --> 18:05.871
See, I'm already chopping you
to kibble!

18:06.411 --> 18:11.872
Too bad I can't be killed even
if cut into a thousand pieces!

18:21.159 --> 18:23.787
Hey, Kir, Rose!

18:26.264 --> 18:28.433
What's wrong with your friends?!

18:28.433 --> 18:32.704
It seems like they are being
overtaken by a new desire.

18:32.704 --> 18:34.171
What are these things?!

18:37.141 --> 18:38.609
They're gold coin beetles!

18:38.609 --> 18:41.245
They feed on the greed of humans!

18:41.245 --> 18:43.372
Have they been coming out
every night to feed?!

18:44.615 --> 18:47.352
You humans will pay for
your impetuous greed!

18:47.352 --> 18:49.616
I will make you suffer for
your selfish attitudes!

18:50.154 --> 18:52.023
These guys can't be killed.

18:52.023 --> 18:54.651
They will continue to feast
on your greed forever!

18:54.892 --> 18:58.963
Your desires will be your downfall.
They make you easy targets!

18:58.963 --> 19:01.666
Our gold is the perfect symbol
for your greed and lust!

19:01.666 --> 19:03.868
Through the use of gold, I will be
able to manipulate your people

19:03.868 --> 19:08.072
until the end of time, for money
is your biggest weakness!

19:08.072 --> 19:10.108
I will use your own desires
to control you

19:10.108 --> 19:12.477
like the puppets you are!

19:12.477 --> 19:15.113
Sometime I'd like to try
stealing the desire

19:15.113 --> 19:17.547
that lies in your own heart.

19:17.949 --> 19:19.678
What did you say you
wanted to steal?!

19:21.419 --> 19:24.252
We humans are just made
to be greedy I guess.

19:24.989 --> 19:28.426
But there are some of us
who can resist

19:28.426 --> 19:31.725
the greedy temptations and desires
of our hearts.

19:32.096 --> 19:35.800
What?! How can you do that?!

19:35.800 --> 19:39.668
It can't be, you bastard!
You must be the Bandit King!

19:40.204 --> 19:41.671
Looks like now's a good time
to start stealing

19:42.473 --> 19:43.940
the very greed and desire
from your heart!

19:45.476 --> 19:47.535
Gold, gold, gold, gold!

19:50.248 --> 19:52.113
Stop it! Don't let the greed
get a hold of you!

19:52.617 --> 19:57.816
Let go of me! Stop it!

20:04.695 --> 20:07.932
To be able to steal my
own powerful desires

20:07.932 --> 20:10.264
you must be none other
than the Bandit King!

20:11.035 --> 20:13.438
Kir, how's your throat feeling?

20:13.438 --> 20:15.406
You want me to sing one last song?

20:15.406 --> 20:18.898
Yeah, let's hear it then, Grappa!

20:40.331 --> 20:41.798
You're the...

20:42.934 --> 20:44.401
...Bandit King.

20:54.078 --> 20:55.602
Give this to your old man.

20:56.280 --> 20:57.713
To Papa?

20:58.082 --> 21:00.718
If you have too much of this,
you'll become a monster.

21:00.718 --> 21:03.312
If you have too little, you'll become
like your dad is now.

21:03.821 --> 21:06.557
Desire really is a dangerous
thing, isn't it?

21:06.557 --> 21:08.115
This is desire?

21:08.960 --> 21:10.427
Yep, now what are you going to do?

21:12.196 --> 21:13.823
I totally ripped it off.

21:15.199 --> 21:16.666
Are you going to arrest me
for stealing?

21:17.468 --> 21:18.935
Yeah, you get life without parole.

21:19.537 --> 21:22.870
I guess the Bandit King can even
steal other people's hearts.

21:24.008 --> 21:26.101
Be careful when dealing with
girls' hearts like that, Jing.
